agnt modifications and additions
-------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2026 smeltery and agnt contributors, for their respective work.

agnt is a modified derivative of Remodex, not an official Remodex release.
Changes include agnt branding, a multi-provider bridge, Linux runtime support,
client integrations, and changes to pairing, session recovery, and the UI.
The Git history records individual changes and their authors.

